--- !u!114 &1356310736
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1356310734}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 1
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Macera, \xE7o\u011Fu hikayenin bitti\u011Fi yerde, en tepede ba\u015Flad\u0131:
    G\xF6ky\xFCz\xFC.\n\nK\xFC\xE7\xFCk k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 top g\xF6zlerini a\xE7t\u0131\u011F\u0131nda
    ayaklar\u0131n\u0131n alt\u0131nda (veya alt\u0131nda olmas\u0131 gereken yerde)
    toprak yoktu; sadece sonsuz bir bo\u015Fluk ve r\xFCzgarla s\xFCr\xFCklenen bulutlar
    vard\u0131. Buras\u0131, hatan\u0131n telafisinin olmad\u0131\u011F\u0131, ba\u015F
    d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCc\xFC bir y\xFCkseklikti. \u0130lk \"boing\" sesi bulutlar\u0131n
    aras\u0131nda kaybolurken, k\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 top her platformdan di\u011Ferine
    ge\xE7erken asl\u0131nda yer\xE7ekimine kar\u015F\u0131 bir dans sergiliyordu.
    Ancak ka\xE7\u0131n\u0131lmaz olan ger\xE7ekle\u015Fti; zirveden a\u015Fa\u011F\u0131ya,
    bulutlar\u0131n aras\u0131ndan s\xFCz\xFClerek ba\u015F d\xF6nd\xFCr\xFCc\xFC
    bir h\u0131zla derinliklere do\u011Fru d\xFC\u015Fmeye ba\u015Flad\u0131.\n\nI\u015F\u0131k
    azald\u0131, r\xFCzgar\u0131n sesi kesildi ve yerini so\u011Fuk, nemli bir yank\u0131ya
    b\u0131rakt\u0131. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 top kendini Ma\u011Fara\u2019n\u0131n
    kalbinde buldu.\n\nG\xF6ky\xFCz\xFCn\xFCn ferahl\u0131\u011F\u0131ndan sonra
    buras\u0131 dar, karanl\u0131k ve tehlikeliydi. Duvarlar \xFCzerine \xFCzerine
    geliyor, keskin dikenler her k\xF6\u015Fede onu bekliyordu. Art\u0131k s\xFCz\xFClmek
    yoktu; hayatta kalmak i\xE7in duvarlardan sekmeli, karanl\u0131k t\xFCnellerde
    y\xF6n\xFCn\xFC bulmal\u0131 ve bu klostrofobik tuzaktan \xE7\u0131k\u0131\u015F
    yolunu aramal\u0131yd\u0131. Ma\u011Fara onu yutmaya \xE7al\u0131\u015Fsa da,
    o inatla parlayan y\u0131ld\u0131zlar\u0131 toplayarak yoluna devam etti. Derinliklerdeki
    bir t\xFCnelin ucunda, c\u0131l\u0131z ama umut verici bir par\u0131lt\u0131
    g\xF6rd\xFC.\n\nSon bir gayretle kendini d\u0131\u015Far\u0131 f\u0131rlatt\u0131\u011F\u0131nda,
    kar\u015F\u0131s\u0131nda sonsuz bir ufuk uzan\u0131yordu. T\xFCnelden \xE7\u0131km\u0131\u015F,
    Deniz \xDCst\xFC\u2019ne ula\u015Fm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131.\n\nKaranl\u0131k geride
    kalm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131 ama macera hen\xFCz bitmemi\u015Fti. \u015Eimdi dalgalar\u0131n
    hemen \xFCzerinde, suyun y\xFCzeyine yak\u0131n platformlarda dengede durmas\u0131
    gerekiyordu. G\xF6ky\xFCz\xFCndeki d\xFC\u015F\xFC\u015Ften ve ma\u011Faradaki
    s\u0131k\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015Fl\u0131ktan sonra, deniz ona nefes ald\u0131rm\u0131\u015Ft\u0131.
    Ancak suyun \xFCzerindeki ah\u015Fap iskeleler kaygand\u0131 ve denge her zamankinden
    daha \xF6nemliydi. K\u0131rm\u0131z\u0131 top, batan g\xFCne\u015Fin turuncu
    \u0131\u015F\u0131klar\u0131 alt\u0131nda son engelleri de a\u015Ft\u0131.\n\nD\xFC\u015F\xFC\u015Fle
    ba\u015Flayan bu yolculuk, denizin huzurlu melodisi e\u015Fli\u011Finde dalgalanan
    biti\u015F bayra\u011F\u0131na ula\u015F\u0131ld\u0131\u011F\u0131nda, ger\xE7ek
    bir \xF6zg\xFCrl\xFCk hikayesine d\xF6n\xFC\u015Ft\xFC."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
